@startuml
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false

actor User
component "脚本 UI\n（管理页 / 编辑器 / 向导 / 日历菜单）" as UI
component "IScriptManager" as Manager
component "WorkerScriptExecutor\n（按 EngineName 路由 supervisor）" as Executor
component "Worker 进程\nC# / Lua / Python" as Worker
component "ScriptExecutionContext\n（context.Api() 门面）" as Context
component "Worker 代理\n（Query / LogItem / Tracker / Sys / Log）" as Proxy
component "WorkItemQueryWorkerDispatcher\n（宿主 HostCall 分派）" as Dispatcher
component "IDiaryApi / ITrackerApi\nSysApi / ILogApi" as HostApi
component "DbInterfaceBase" as Db
database "SQLite / PostgreSQL" as Store

rectangle "ScriptEditorTarget\nKind: Year / Quarter / Month / Week / Day / WorkItem" as Target

User --> UI : 执行 / 编辑 / 触发
UI --> Manager : ExecuteAsync(request)
Manager --> Executor : 校验目标与超时
Executor --> Worker : stdin/stdout JSON 行协议\nHello / Execute / HostCall / Cancel
Worker --> Context : 注入契约与目标
Context --> Proxy : HostCall
Proxy --> Dispatcher : worker 协议消息
Dispatcher --> HostApi : 只读查询 / 创建 / 目录 / 交互
HostApi --> Db
Db --> Store : 核心表与扩展表

UI ..> Target : 编辑器目标（含日期范围）
Target ..> Manager : 目标校验与解析

note bottom of Dispatcher
  结果类方法（query / logItems.create /
  templateLogItems.create / trackerInstances.get）
  返回 { succeeded, error, apiError } 结果对象；
  非结果类 HostCall 失败走错误信封。
  脚本 API 不暴露远程 Tracker 写入。
end note
@enduml
